## Hard constraints (do not violate)

- **$0/month experiment:** free APIs + seed fallbacks; no Redis/DB/auth on the public sports app unless explicitly requested
- **Family-friendly:** no betting/odds widgets; ads stay behind kill switches and off bracket/match cards
- **Cascade:** live API → open mirror → local seed; never expose API keys to the client
- **Registry:** `lib/sports.ts` is the sports source of truth (`CURRENT_SPORT_SLUG` = homepage)

## Backend patterns

- Prefer Server Components in `components/sports/*PageContent.tsx` for sports data (not new REST unless needed)
- BFF only for news/facts/feedback under `app/api/`
- Club leagues: `stage: "LEAGUE"`, matchday in `group`; reuse `lib/league-standings.ts` + `match-schedule.ts`
- Homepage `/` redirects via `middleware.ts` using essential cookie `motempo-sports-last-sport` (see `lib/last-sport.ts`); falls back to `CURRENT_SPORT_SLUG`
- When requirements change, **update `docs/` in the same change**
- New sport routes: add the slug to `middleware.ts` `config.matcher` so last-viewed recall works
